    {
      "name": "Mental Mire",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>A non-flying creature damaged by the dread empathnid's psychic web Strike or psychic burst is Immobilized, stuck to the ground or nearest adjacent surface until it Escapes. A flying creature must instead succeed at a DC 18 Reflex Saving Throw save or fall 20 feet (or 40 feet on a critical failure).</p>",
